  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT WOULD FINANCE INVESTMENTS IN PRIMARY INFRASTRUCTURE AND URBAN SERVICES IN THE CITIES OF GEORGETOWN, NEW AMSTERDAM, LINDEN, ROSE HALL AND CORRIVERTON. IN ADDITION, THE PROJECT WOULD ASSIST IN IMPROVING URBAN MANAGEMENT AND FINANCE A PILOT LOW-INCOME HOUSING PROJECT</narrative>
